    Assertion:ready-signals-back,sentence:a ready peer hearing an unenabled protocol signals no_protocol back naming the type — the sender learns instead of losing it silently
    Assertion:complainer-still-acks,sentence:the complainer still acks the original so the sender stops retransmitting — a definitive answer not a silent black hole
